{
  "description": "Supplies SupplyTracker recognises by id. \"multiBiteFood\": food eaten in parts, each family's stages from the full item down to the last bite (pizzas: full, then 1/2; pies: full, then half, then the pie dish, which is not food; cakes: full, then 2/3, then a slice). \"chargedItems\": items used per charge, each family's stages from the highest charge down to 1, with the charges core ItemWithCharge gives them (its TELEPORT and FUNGICIDE_SPRAY types); the trimmed glory and the imbued ring of wealth are families of their own; uncharged variants and items that never run out are not listed. \"teleportScrolls\": the scrolls core ItemIdentification lists as Type.SCROLL. Only unnoted ids are listed: noted items are never supplies. Ids are RuneLite 1.13.6 gameval constants (net.runelite.api.gameval); \"constant\" names the constant each id was taken from.",
